{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hashicorp/vagrant/issues/6608","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hashicorp/vagrant","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hashicorp/vagrant/issues/6608/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hashicorp/vagrant/issues/6608/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hashicorp/vagrant/issues/6608/events","html_url":"https://github.com/hashicorp/vagrant/issues/6608","id":119182574,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUxMTkxODI1NzQ=","number":6608,"title":"Vagrant cannot detect CoreOS network interface names","user":{"login":"jharshman","id":9647217,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2NDcyMTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9647217?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jharshman","html_url":"https://github.com/jharshman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jharshman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jharshman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jharshman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jharshman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jharshman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jharshman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jharshman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jharshman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jharshman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":25816,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNTgxNg==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hashicorp/vagrant/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"e11d21","default":true,"description":null},{"id":218287452,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMTgyODc0NTI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hashicorp/vagrant/labels/guest/coreos","name":"guest/coreos","color":"5319e7","default":false,"description":null},{"id":283683436,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM2ODM0MzY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hashicorp/vagrant/labels/has-pr","name":"has-pr","color":"fef2c0","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2015-11-27T11:42:07Z","updated_at":"2020-04-05T02:27:21Z","closed_at":"2016-02-03T15:14:43Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"# Issue:\n\nCurrent regex in plugins/guests/coreos/cap/configure_networks.rb doesn't match on ethX interface naming convention.  Causes issues when trying to configure network interfaces in a cluster.\n`comm.sudo(\"ifconfig | grep 'enp0\\\\|ens' | cut -f1 -d:\") do |_, result|`\n## To Reproduce\n\nVagrant Version 1.7.2\nLibvirt Version 1.2.13.1\nCoreOS LibVirt Base Box available from Atlas: \nvagrant init jharshman/coreos-stable; vagrant up --provider=libvirt\nVagrantFile and supporting cloud init files can be found here:\n[CoreOS Config Gist](https://gist.github.com/jharshman/97c7c16a40ddd562293a)\n## Debug Gist from Vagrant Up\n\n[Vagrant Debug Gist](https://gist.github.com/jharshman/869bf907f3074d1566ef)\n## Suggested Fix (tested)\n\nModify regular expression to match on the ethX pattern and be a bit more detailed with matching on the other patterns\n`comm.sudo(\"ifconfig | grep -E '(e[n,t][h,s,p][[:digit:]]([a-z][[:digit:]])?)' | cut -f1 -d:\") do |_,result|`\n","closed_by":{"login":"sethvargo","id":408570,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwODU3MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/408570?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethvargo","html_url":"https://github.com/sethvargo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethvargo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethvargo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethvargo/gists{/gist